+- **Editable vs forbidden:** `maos-a2a-core` is the seam (editable). `maos-a2a` (>1500 LOC) and `maos-a2a-tcp` (>ceiling, the 8.13 constraint) are **edit-forbidden** without explicit re-scope. Kernel byte-identical.
